OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 3 MAR
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GAl Ryan with concert recordings
OL,6,     Gof distinctive settings of the
OL,7,     Gchurch mass, today with music by
OL,8,     GKarl Jenkins, plus music from the
OL,9,     Grecent Belfast International
OL,10,     GChamber Music Festival.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Sibelius
OL,12,     GKate Molleson surveys the Third
OL,13,     GSymphony by Sibelius and the
OL,14,     Gperiod it was composed - a work
OL,15,     Gwhich led one critic to call
OL,16,     GSibelius a Classical Master.
OL,17,G1700FIn Tune
OL,18,     GKatie Derham introduces live
OL,19,     Gmusic from EMPOWER: Women
OL,20,     GChanging Music, and conductor
OL,21,     GPaavo Jarvi and pianist Alexandre
OL,22,     GKantorow join us in the studio.
